Error [E2502]: a line stream can only be used directly in a loop
  --> tests/ui/line_stream_escapes_loop.jet:5:20
    |
  5 |     rows :: reader.lines()
    |                    ^^^^^
 Why: `.lines()` hands back a lazy line reader meant to be iterated in place; storing it in a name would let it leave the loop, where it has no use
 Fix: iterate it directly: `loop rows in handle.lines() { … }`
